{"about_the_game":"Work your way to the top of a cutthroat game studio in this roguelike deckbuilder inspired by retro JRPGs! Crush the Industry features strategic combat with a twist and deep replayability.<br><br>This free playable demo features unrestricted play for the game's first floor.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1816010/extras/healthrollGif.gif?t=1745298199\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>High Replayability</strong>: <strong>Over 200 skills &amp; talents</strong> with an ever-changing schedule ensures that <strong>every career run will be unique</strong>!  <br></li><li><strong>Innovative Mechanics</strong>: The <strong>rolling health</strong> system will keep you on your toes while your <strong>sanity</strong> may result in unpredictable effects. <strong>Cycling</strong> allows you to strategically draw new skills and prepare satisfying combos.    <br></li><li><strong>Playstyle Options</strong>: A charming and motley cast of playable characters awaits you. Whether you want to take your time carefully planning or play in the fast lane, you've got options.  </li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1816010?t=1745298199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1816010?t=1745298199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1816010/48a5a6c8fae8ee3977d89d8dc8385e55b431dcfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745298199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1816010/48a5a6c8fae8ee3977d89d8dc8385e55b431dcfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745298199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Work your way to the top of a cutthroa